msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

msgid "## Supported Scenarios"
msgstr "## 支持场景"

msgid "## Constraints"
msgstr "## 约束条件"

msgid ""
"Decode Context Parallel (DCP) shards the KV cache along the sequence "
"dimension across devices in a Tensor Parallel (TP) group. It removes "
"redundant KV-cache copies and can increase the batch size available for "
"long-context decoding."
msgstr ""
"解码上下文并行（DCP）将KV缓存沿序列维度在张量并行（TP）组内的设备间进行分片。它消除了冗余的KV缓存副本，并可为长上下文解码增加可用的批处理大小。"

msgid ""
"Prefill Context Parallel is not supported by vLLM Ascend. The upstream "
"`prefill_context_parallel_size` option must remain at its default value of "
"`1`."
msgstr ""
"vLLM Ascend不支持预填充上下文并行。上游的`prefill_context_parallel_size`选项必须保持默认值`1`。"

msgid ""
"DSA-CP is a separate sparse-attention optimization controlled by "
"`additional_config.enable_dsa_cp`. See [Additional "
"Configuration](../configuration/additional_config.md) for its configuration "
"and model requirements."
msgstr ""
"DSA-"
"CP是由`additional_config.enable_dsa_cp`控制的独立稀疏注意力优化。有关其配置和模型要求，请参阅[附加配置](../configuration/additional_config.md)。"

msgid ""
"DCP supports eager and graph execution, prefix caching, chunked prefill, "
"speculative decoding, P/D disaggregation, and MLAPO on the model and "
"hardware combinations documented by vLLM Ascend. The following table shows "
"whether each feature can be combined with DCP across devices and attention "
"backends:"
msgstr ""
"DCP在vLLM "
"Ascend记录的模型和硬件组合上支持eager和图执行、前缀缓存、分块预填充、推测解码、P/D分离以及MLAPO。下表显示了各功能在设备和注意力后端上是否可以与DCP组合使用："

msgid ""
"| Device | Attention Backend | Chunked Prefill + DCP | Prefix Caching + DCP "
"| Graph Mode + DCP | P/D Disaggregation + DCP | MLAPO + DCP | Speculative "
"Decoding + DCP |"
msgstr ""
"| 设备 | 注意力后端 | 分块预填充 + DCP | 前缀缓存 + DCP | 图模式 + DCP | P/D分离 + DCP | MLAPO + "
"DCP | 推测解码 + DCP |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend A2/A3 | MLA/GQA | 🟢 Supported | 🟢 Supported | 🟢 Supported | 🟢 "
"Supported | 🟢 Supported (MLA)<br>— Not applicable (GQA) | 🟢 P/D "
"disaggregation<br>🔴 PD-mixed deployment |"
msgstr ""
"| Ascend A2/A3 | MLA/GQA | 🟢 支持 | 🟢 支持 | 🟢 支持 | 🟢 支持 | 🟢 支持（MLA）<br>— "
"不适用（GQA） | 🟢 P/D分离<br>🔴 PD混合部署 |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend A2/A3 | SFA | 🟢 Supported | 🟢 Supported | 🟢 Supported | 🟢 Supported"
" | 🟢 Supported | 🟢 Supported |"
msgstr "| Ascend A2/A3 | SFA | 🟢 支持 | 🟢 支持 | 🟢 支持 | 🟢 支持 | 🟢 支持 | 🟢 支持 |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend 950 | MLA/GQA | 🔵 Experimental | 🔵 Experimental | 🔵 Experimental | "
"🔵 Experimental | 🔵 Experimental (MLA)<br>— Not applicable (GQA) | 🔵 P/D "
"disaggregation<br>🔴 PD-mixed deployment |"
msgstr ""
"| Ascend 950 | MLA/GQA | 🔵 实验性 | 🔵 实验性 | 🔵 实验性 | 🔵 实验性 | 🔵 实验性（MLA）<br>— "
"不适用（GQA） | 🔵 P/D分离<br>🔴 PD混合部署 |"

msgid ""
"| Ascend 950 | SFA | 🔴 Not supported | 🔴 Not supported | 🔴 Not supported | 🔴"
" Not supported | 🔴 Not supported | 🔴 Not supported |"
msgstr "| Ascend 950 | SFA | 🔴 不支持 | 🔴 不支持 | 🔴 不支持 | 🔴 不支持 | 🔴 不支持 | 🔴 不支持 |"

msgid ""
"- 🟢 **Supported**: Combining the feature with DCP is supported.\n"
"- 🔵 **Experimental**: Combining the feature with DCP is experimentally supported; interfaces and functionality may change.\n"
"- 🔴 **Not supported**: Combining the feature with DCP is not supported.\n"
"- **Not applicable**: The feature does not apply to this attention backend."
msgstr ""
"- 🟢 **支持**：支持将该功能与DCP组合使用。\n"
"- 🔵 **实验性**：实验性支持将该功能与DCP组合使用；接口和功能可能会发生变化。\n"
"- 🔴 **不支持**：不支持将该功能与DCP组合使用。\n"
"- **不适用**：该功能不适用于此注意力后端。"

msgid "## Usage"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid "DCP reuses the TP devices and does not increase the world size."
msgstr "DCP复用TP设备，不会增加世界大小。"

msgid ""
"- For an MLA model such as DeepSeek-R1:\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`\n"
"- For a GQA model such as Qwen3-235B:\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`\n"
"- In a KV-cache transfer scenario such as KV pooling or P/D disaggregation, set `cp_kv_cache_interleave_size` to the KV-cache `block_size` (default: 128):"
msgstr ""
"- 对于MLA模型（如DeepSeek-R1）：\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`\n"
"- 对于GQA模型（如Qwen3-235B）：\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`\n"
"- 在KV缓存传输场景（如KV池化或P/D分离）中，将`cp_kv_cache_interleave_size`设置为KV缓存的`block_size`（默认值：128）："

msgid "# Context Parallel Guide"
msgstr "# 上下文并行指南"

msgid ""
"The context parallel features include Decode Context Parallel (DCP) and DSA-"
"CP."
msgstr "上下文并行功能包括解码上下文并行（DCP）和DSA-CP。"

msgid ""
"DSA-CP supports prefix caching, chunked prefill, speculative decoding, P/D "
"disaggregation on the model and hardware combinations documented by vLLM "
"Ascend."
msgstr "DSA-CP支持vLLM Ascend文档中记录的模型和硬件组合上的前缀缓存、分块预填充、推测解码和P/D分离。"

